Z||000008||Kelvin Vivian||01-24-2001||07:35 PM||||Instead of turboing the $50 junkyard V-12, you could try removing the spare tire from the front compartment and replacing it with the original Fiero motor in your car. It'll probably help restore the 43/57 weight balance with the V-12 behind you. <P>An 18-cyl Fiero... bring that to a car show, running, and you will be sure to win some kind of award...||||reg||1
